# Panel de control de la RG Slide (rgslide-ui). Formato: ver docs/agent-control.md
title Ajustes de la Slide
status rgslide-ctl status power; rgslide-ctl status wifi; rgslide-ctl status bt; rgslide-ctl status screen | head -n 1; rgslide-ctl status time
slider|Brillo|5|100|5|rgslide-ctl brightness get|rgslide-ctl brightness set %d
slider|Volumen|0|100|5|rgslide-ctl volume get|rgslide-ctl volume set %d
choice|Pantalla (al reiniciar ES)|rgslide-ctl display get|rgslide-ctl display set %s|60,120,auto
choice|Ventilador|rgslide-ctl fan get|rgslide-ctl fan mode %s|auto,off,max
choice|Bluetooth|rgslide-ctl bt get|rgslide-ctl bt power %s|off,on
list|Wifi: buscar redes y conectar|rgslide-ctl wifi list|rgslide-ctl wifi connect %s %p
list|Wifi: olvidar una red guardada|rgslide-ctl wifi saved|rgslide-ctl wifi forget %s
list|Bluetooth: buscar y emparejar|rgslide-ctl bt scan 10|rgslide-ctl bt pair %s
list|Bluetooth: conectar un dispositivo emparejado|rgslide-ctl bt devices|rgslide-ctl bt connect %s
run|Red e IP|rgslide-ctl net
run|Estado completo|rgslide-ctl status all
run|Hora: sincronizar con internet|rgslide-ctl time sync
run|Hora: adelantar 1 hora|rgslide-ctl time adjust +60
run|Hora: atrasar 1 hora|rgslide-ctl time adjust -60
run|Hora: adelantar 10 minutos|rgslide-ctl time adjust +10
run|Hora: atrasar 10 minutos|rgslide-ctl time adjust -10
list|Zona horaria|rgslide-ctl time list|rgslide-ctl time tz %s
choice|Idioma|rgslide-ctl lang get|rgslide-ctl lang set %s|auto,es,en
confirm|Cerrar juego y volver a EmulationStation|rgslide-ctl kill-game
confirm|Reiniciar la Slide|rgslide-ctl reboot
confirm|Apagar la Slide|rgslide-ctl poweroff
